      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:28.894000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Sorry, can you say that again? You cut out for a second.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:29.470000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:34.085000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "I think that's mostly right, but there's a nuance I mean, there.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:34.843000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:39.458000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "What- What about Acmeway?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:40.277000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:41.815000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "They signed I mean, at twenty.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:42.740000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:45.048000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
      },
      "text": "Acmeway keeps twenty for the I mean, pilot year. We honour it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:45.353000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:49.969000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "write, right.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:50.881000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:51.681000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "Keep going.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:51.991000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:52.791000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Let's make sure sales and marketing hear this at the same time.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:53.753000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:58.369000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "That's um, fair. I hadn't thought about it that that way.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:59.514000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:03.745000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I'm worried about how this lands with existing customers.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:03.965000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:07.427000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
      },
      "text": "Totally.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:06.217000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:06.817000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "I'd",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:08.187000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:08.987000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "rather make a call today than drag it out.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:09.601000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:13.063000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah- Yeah, that makes sense sense to me.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:14.038000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:17.115000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, I agree with that.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:17.631000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:19.554000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "And.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:20.308000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:21.108000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
      },
      "text": "Cool, I'll let you all go. Thanks.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:21.855000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:24.547000Z"
    }
  ]
}
